# 608-2RS outer ring: D 22, B 7, raceway groove, seal recesses
# source: ISO 15 / SPEC 6.2, 7; groove radius 0.53 Dw, depth 0.75 and the recess representative
# frame: origin at the bearing's centre, z along its axis

shared ro = 11   # outside
shared rl = 8.7345   # land (shoulder) radius
shared rs = 9.7   # seal recess
shared zs = 2.55   # recess floor: the seal's inner face
shared hb = 3.5
shared ch = 0.3   # outside chamfer r 0.3
shared rg = 2.10357
shared rgc = 7.38093

sketch prof(on: xz) {
  o = poly([(rl, -zs), (rs, -zs), (rs, -hb), (ro - ch, -hb), (ro, -hb + ch), (ro, hb - ch), (ro - ch, hb), (rs, hb), (rs, zs), (rl, zs)])
  pz0 = pt(0, 0)
  zax = line((0, 0), (0, hb), construction: true)
  xax = line((0, 0), (ro, 0), construction: true)
}
ring = revolve(prof.o, axis: prof.zax)
sketch gs(on: prof) {
  g = circle((rgc, 0), rg)
  zax = line((0, 0), (0, hb), construction: true)
}
groove = revolve(gs.g, axis: gs.zax, cut: true)

ax = anchor(plane(at: prof.pz0, normal: prof.zax.dir, x: prof.xax.dir))

expect valid
expect bodies = 1
expect volume = 775.479 +- 0.1%
